        <procedure title="Add Capacity" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Capacity</p>
            <p>Adds a new capacity entry with specific evaluation and share inclusion settings</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker-generated mapping reference</p>
            <step>Navigate to capacities settings</step>
            <step>Click 'Add', fill in name, mapping reference, select from dropdown, toggle checkboxes, save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Capacity is saved and confirmation message appears</p>
            </chapter>
